<section class="show sec geo" data-od-id="app-showcase">
  <div class="show-mesh" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
      <defs>
        <radialGradient id="sM1" cx="86%" cy="6%" r="60%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#29603E" stop-opacity=".12"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#29603E" stop-opacity=".04"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#29603E" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
        <radialGradient id="sM2" cx="6%" cy="100%" r="60%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FAF7F0" stop-opacity=".9"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#FAF7F0" stop-opacity=".3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FAF7F0" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
      </defs>
      <rect width="1440" height="900" fill="#F8FAF8"/>
      <rect width="1440" height="900" fill="url(#sM1)"/>
      <rect width="1440" height="900" fill="url(#sM2)"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap show-inner">
    <div class="show-grid">
      <div class="show-phones reveal">
        <!-- Dhikr (back) -->
        <div class="mini-device back">
          <div class="mini-screen dhikr-mock">
            <div class="dhikr-body">
              <div class="dhikr-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">سُبْحَانَ اللهِ</div>
              <div class="dhikr-ph">Subhan Allah</div>
              <div class="dhikr-mean">Glory be to Allah</div>
              <div class="tasbih-beads" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              <div class="dhikr-count" id="dhikrCount">33</div>
              <button class="dhikr-ring" type="button" id="tasbihTap">tap</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Home (front) -->
        <div class="mini-device front">
          <div class="mini-screen home-mock">
            <div class="home-mesh" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 300 620" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><radialGradient id="hm1" cx="12%" cy="0%" r="70%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FAF7F0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FAF7F0" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><radialGradient id="hm2" cx="100%" cy="38%" r="55%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#DDE8E1"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#DDE8E1" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs><rect width="300" height="620" fill="#F8FAF8"/><rect width="300" height="620" fill="url(#hm1)"/><rect width="300" height="620" fill="url(#hm2)"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="home-body">
              <div class="home-greet-eye">Assalamu alaikum</div>
              <div class="home-greet">Salah rhythm</div>
              <div class="home-hero-card">
                <div class="hh-eye">Next prayer</div>
                <div class="hh-name">Maghrib</div>
                <div class="hh-time">5:58 PM · lock opens in 14m</div>
              </div>
              <div class="home-ledger">
                <div class="home-row done"><span class="hr-name">Fajr</span><span class="hr-time">Prayed</span><span class="hr-dot"></span></div>
                <div class="home-row done"><span class="hr-name">Dhuhr</span><span class="hr-time">Prayed</span><span class="hr-dot"></span></div>
                <div class="home-row"><span class="hr-name">Asr</span><span class="hr-time">3:36</span><span class="hr-dot"></span></div>
                <div class="home-row live"><span class="hr-name">Maghrib</span><span class="hr-time">Now</span><span class="hr-dot"></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="phone-dua" lang="ar" dir="rtl">اللهم أعني على ذكرك وشكرك وحسن عبادتك</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal d1">
        <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:0">
          <span class="eyebrow">A companion, not a feed</span>
          <h2>Calm by design, <span class="it">all day.</span></h2>
          <p>Between prayers, Barakah stays out of the way. When you open it, there's no infinite scroll — just what matters.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="show-feature-list">
          <li>
            <span class="sf-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m16.24 7.76-2.12 6.36-6.36 2.12 2.12-6.36 6.36-2.12z"/></svg></span>
            <span><b>Times &amp; qibla, always honest.</b> Local masjid where possible, with MWL, ISNA, Egyptian and Umm al-Qura available — overridable per prayer.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="sf-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"/><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"/></svg></span>
            <span><b>Adhan, gently.</b> A calm call at each window — never a barrage of notifications begging for attention.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="sf-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg></span>
            <span><b>A quiet dhikr counter.</b> Tasbih after salah, counted with a tap. No badges, no leaderboards — just you and the remembrance.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
